{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 84,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician upon Gittith, A Psalm for the sons of Korah. How amiable ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy tabernacles, O LORD of hosts!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My soul longeth, and even fainteth for the courts of the LORD: my heart and my flesh crieth out for the living God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yes, the sparrow hath found a house, and the swallow a nest for herself, where she may lay her young, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy altars, O LORD of hosts, my King, and my God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they that dwell in thy house: they will be still praising thee. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man whose strength ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in thee; in whose heart ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the ways ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " passing through the valley of Baca make it a well; the rain also filleth the pools.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They go from strength to strength, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "every one of them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Zion appeareth before God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O LORD God of hosts, hear my prayer: give ear, O God of Jacob. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, O God our shield, and look upon the face of thy anointed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For a day in thy courts ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " better than a thousand. I had rather be a door-keeper in the house of my God, than to dwell in the tents of wickedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the LORD God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a sun and shield: the LORD will give grace and glory: no good will he withhold from them that walk uprightly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.84.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.84.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O LORD of hosts, blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man that trusteth in thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
